+# pane is moved, no transform is applied, no slot is taken. The host
+# (hud_manual.c dm_hud_probe_tick, once per present) formats the records
+# into "[hudprobe] ..." log lines. It takes everything through its
+# arguments, so these words are position-independent and relocation-free:
+#   x0 = the pane, x1 = the aspect (state + 0x58), x2 = the table (state +
+#   0x300), x3 = the probe buffer (state + 0x3300).
+# What it logs (first sighting per pane address, 256 addresses; the host
+# flushes the 13-record buffer every present, so a 5-second stand-still
+# logs every pane): the pane's name, parent, size, origin, flags and
